{
 "title": "Diaspora",
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Diaspora",
   "card": false,
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "c122",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Hope flares one more time.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c123",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In 132, a leader named Simon bar Kokhba revolts again.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c124",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Rome crushes it by 135 at terrible cost.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c125",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The emperor Hadrian bans Jews from Jerusalem",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c126",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and renames the province Syria Palaestina.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c127",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The name that Palestine comes from.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c128",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "So now the people have no temple, no capital,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c129",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and in most of the land, no permission to live there.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c130",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "What do they have?",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c131",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The book, over the next few centuries,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c132",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "rabbis in Galilee and in Babylon,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c133",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "write down their traditions,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c134",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "the Mishnah, then the Talmud,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c135",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "a nation packed into a library,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c136",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and a library can travel anywhere.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c137",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Meanwhile, the little movement around Jesus grows",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c138",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and slowly splits away from Judaism.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c139",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In the early 300s,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c140",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "the Roman emperor Constantine embraces Christianity.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c141",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And within about 70 years,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c142",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "it is the empire's official religion.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c143",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Now the land that Jews are barred from",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c144",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "is a Christian holy land,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c145",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "with great churches rising over the places of the gospels.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c146",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "For Jews, the next centuries bring new bans,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c147",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "forced conversions, and revolts that fail.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c148",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "But the book keeps them together, the diaspora.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c149",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "For about 1800 years,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c150",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "most Jews live as a minority somewhere else.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c151",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "After 638, many live under Islamic rule,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c152",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "which takes Jerusalem that year.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c153",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Jews and Christians there are protected but second class.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c154",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "They pay a special tax and live under rules.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c155",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Sometimes that is mild, sometimes it isn't.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c156",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "But compared with what's coming in Christian Europe,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c157",
     "shot": "g_diaspora",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "it is often calmer.",
     "date": null
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}